Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: VAR declList compoundStmt DOT

    2 declList: declarationList

    3 declarationList: declaration SEMI
    4                | declarationList declaration SEMI

    5 declaration: ID COLON dataType
    6            | ID COLON arrayType

    7 dataType: BOOLEAN
    8         | CHAR
    9         | INTEGER
   10         | REAL
   11         | INT
   12         | FLOAT
   13         | STRING
   14         | CHAR_T

   15 arrayType: ARRAY LBRACK INT_LITERAL RBRACK OF dataType

   16 compoundStmt: BEGIN_ statements END

   17 statements: statementList

   18 statementList: statement
   19              | statementList SEMI statement

   20 statement: simpleStmt
   21          | structuredStmt

   22 simpleStmt: assignmentStmt
   23           | ioStmt

   24 assignmentStmt: ID ASSIGN expr

   25 ioStmt: READ LPAREN ID RPAREN
   26       | WRITE LPAREN ID RPAREN

   27 structuredStmt: compoundStmt
   28               | ifStmt
   29               | whileStmt

   30 ifStmt: IF condition THEN statement
   31       | IF condition THEN statement ELSE statement

   32 whileStmt: WHILE condition DO statement

   33 condition: orCondition

   34 orCondition: andCondition
   35            | andCondition OR andCondition

   36 andCondition: notCondition
   37             | notCondition AND notCondition

   38 notCondition: NOT notCondition
   39             | LPAREN expr relOp expr RPAREN

   40 relOp: LT
   41      | LE
   42      | EQ
   43      | NE
   44      | GE
   45      | GT

   46 expr: term
   47     | term PLUS term
   48     | term MINUS term

   49 term: factor
   50     | factor MUL factor
   51     | factor DIV factor
   52     | factor MOD factor

   53 factor: ID
   54       | INT_LITERAL
   55       | FLOAT_LITERAL
   56       | STRING_LITERAL
   57       | CHAR_LITERAL
   58       | LPAREN expr RPAREN


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    LOWER_THAN_ELSE (258)
    VAR (259) 1
    BEGIN_ (260) 16
    END (261) 16
    IF (262) 30 31
    THEN (263) 30 31
    ELSE (264) 31
    WHILE (265) 32
    DO (266) 32
    READ (267) 25
    WRITE (268) 26
    BOOLEAN (269) 7
    CHAR (270) 8
    INTEGER (271) 9
    REAL (272) 10
    INT (273) 11
    FLOAT (274) 12
    STRING (275) 13
    CHAR_T (276) 14
    ARRAY (277) 15
    OF (278) 15
    COLON (279) 5 6
    SEMI (280) 3 4 19
    DOT (281) 1
    LPAREN (282) 25 26 39 58
    RPAREN (283) 25 26 39 58
    LBRACK (284) 15
    RBRACK (285) 15
    ID (286) 5 6 24 25 26 53
    INT_LITERAL (287) 15 54
    FLOAT_LITERAL (288) 55
    STRING_LITERAL (289) 56
    CHAR_LITERAL (290) 57
    PLUS (291) 47
    MINUS (292) 48
    MUL (293) 50
    DIV (294) 51
    MOD (295) 52
    ASSIGN (296) 24
    LT (297) 40
    LE (298) 41
    EQ (299) 42
    NE (300) 43
    GE (301) 44
    GT (302) 45
    AND (303) 37
    OR (304) 35
    NOT (305) 38


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (51)
        on left: 0
    program (52)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    declList (53)
        on left: 2
        on right: 1
    declarationList (54)
        on left: 3 4
        on right: 2 4
